[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2714189679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103912#issuecomment-2714189679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103912","id":2714189679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hxz9v","user":{"login":"unvermuthet","id":40361609,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzYxNjA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40361609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet","html_url":"https://github.com/unvermuthet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unvermuthet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T13:14:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T13:14:28Z","body":"To give some more context for why this is important:\r\n\r\nThis isn't particularly crutial for VideoStreams of local files. The impact is more so on any VideoStream trying to implement streaming over the network. There, the aspect ratio, and less importantly the resolution, might not be known ahead of time or could even change during playback to adjust to the available bandwidth.\r\n\r\nPersonally speaking, this one is quite a blocker for [Godot NDI](https://github.com/unvermuthet/godot-ndi/) and currently requires a very ugly workaround. It would be awesome to get some eyes on this and hopefully have it cherry-picked for a 4.4.x release. Le